{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmFkLUNvcC0yMDI0Lw","type":"series","name":"Bad Cop","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9VtAKcZoGD5gKhMG7ACJOsE1XRk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4M8NgEJMn3mmR3iYakZLHw5O2HR.jpg","description":"Twin brothers on the opposite sides of the law get caught in a complex web of deceit, loyalty and betrayal.\n\nRated TV-MA · Returning Series · First aired 20 Jun 2024 · India · Language: Hindi\nStudio: Fremantle India (IN) · Network: Disney+ Hotstar\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Drama","Crime","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmFkLUNvcC0yMDI0Lw.1.1","title":"Karan Ya Arjun","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-06-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Petty thief Arjun accidentally witnesses a crime. Kazbe rules the underground from inside the prison. Police inspector Karan gets a tip-off about a dubious consignment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4uXojjFtQJg4XV6nFgwgVYQ93Pj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmFkLUNvcC0yMDI0Lw.1.2","title":"Pehchan Kaun","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-06-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"CIB officer Khan finds CCTV footage of Karan and learns his secret. A guilt-ridden Arjun leaves a letter for Devika. On his way out of the city, he gets attacked again.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ivfWvfGQnKu6vQvXTs8Mj9vOhMM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmFkLUNvcC0yMDI0Lw.1.3","title":"Chori Chupke","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Khan suspects Karan is in touch with Arjun. On Arjun's first day at the police station, Devika questions him about the ambush. Chasing Raghav, they learn about Kazbe's consignment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rPZgFA02J